	"title": "Sine Curve Staircase",
	"lookup_name": "Wavefunctions_Sky_Stairs",
	"description": "A vertical amphitheater where you are launched 10 units skyward, then descend through sine-modulated cylinder staircases. Each step follows sin(t)—climbing stairs IS tracing a waveform. Floating cube fields at varying heights sample 3D space. Mathematical objects await at the deep stage below. The tallest structure in the wavefunctions sequence.",
